  "Failed to load the dataset ({0}).\n\nBuild it with \"npm run data\" and serve the app with \"npm run serve\".": "无法加载数据集（{0}）。\n\n请使用“npm run data”构建数据，并使用“npm run serve”启动应用。",
  "Set the rectangle size to any single metric or blend your own composite with the weight sliders; recolour by domain, package, kind, stereotype, heat maps or Lua exposure; regroup the whole tree by package, domain, stereotype or kind; change the tiling algorithm, padding, depth limit and small-node culling. Settings persist in localStorage and the current view is encoded in the URL — use the Permalink button to share an exact configuration.": "按代码量等指标调整矩形大小；按源代码语言、目录、声明种类或热力值着色。逐层缩放目录与文件，筛选语言，开启成员以查看细节。设置会保存在本地，也可通过永久链接分享。",
  "Configuration is stored in <code>localStorage</code> under the single key ": "配置保存在 <code>localStorage</code> 中，键名为 ",
  "<code>zombie-atlas.settings.v1</code> (size metric, colours, grouping, layout, filters, panel visibility). ": "<code>zombie-atlas.settings.v1</code>（大小指标、颜色、分组、布局、筛选和面板可见性）。",
  "The view, zoom path, selection and filter summary also travel in the URL hash, so a permalink reproduces what you see. ": "视图、缩放路径、选择和筛选摘要也记录在 URL 的片段中，因此固定链接能够复现当前视图。",
  "On load every field is validated and anything missing or malformed falls back to its default, then the repaired payload is written back — ": "加载时会校验每个字段，缺失或格式错误的值将回退为默认值，然后保存修复后的配置。",
  "so clearing storage, hand-editing it or upgrading the app can never wedge the UI.": "因此清空存储、手动编辑配置或升级应用不会导致界面无法使用。",
  "To start over, press <b>Restore defaults</b> at the bottom of the View controls, or run ": "要重新开始，请点击视图控制底部的<b>恢复默认设置</b>，或在控制台中运行 ",
  "<code>zombieAtlas.store.resetSettings()</code> in the console. Remove the URL hash as well if a bookmark is re-applying filters.": "<code>zombieAtlas.store.resetSettings()</code>。如果书签重新应用了筛选条件，还需要移除 URL 的片段。",
